        <p class="body-m">
            I've been working as a designer for about 15 years. In that time, I've worked with a wide range of clients, from small local businesses to large international companies.
            From 2012 to 2015, I ran a successful mobile app development business, specialising in building iOS apps and web services.
        </p>
        <p class="body-m">
            I believe that good design can solve almost any problem, and I'm passionate about using my skills to help people and organisations achieve their goals.
        </p>
        <p class="body-m">
            Since 2015 I've been working on a full-time freelance basis, and since 2018 have been working exclusively within the Public Sector.
        </p>
        <h2 class="heading-m">Away from work</h2>
        <p class="body-m">
            Away from work, you can usually find me doing something with my family. With a wife and two young children, there's always something going on.
        </p>
        <p class="body-m">
            I started running in early 2024 and quickly got hooked. After completing a couple of half marathons that year, I ran my first full marathon at the Yorkshire Marathon in 2025. I missed out on finishing in under 3:30 by a minute, so there's unfinished business for the next one.
        </p>

